From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:08:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] BlueOS: Etar: "Date and calendar" widget

2x2 widget next to the agenda one: today's date (big day number in the accent
color, weekday, month) and the next two events within a week, in the system
palette colors (accent, dark theme). Refreshes on calendar changes, when the
first shown event ends and at midnight; without calendar access it asks to
open the app.

